---
Modifications by Mneme (2026-10): the deterministic English-grading kernels
(app/backend/exams.py normalize_answer / answer_forms / answer_ok / _order_key and the
dictation scoring; app/backend/patterns.py fixed_parts / contains_pattern / uses_pattern /
_match; app/backend/words.py word_forms; app/backend/pronoun_check.py find_errors / apply)
were rewritten as 3O elements (oprim.english_grading, oprim.english_pronoun,
oskill.english_answer_check_skill). The Turkish `lang` branch was dropped and feedback is in
Chinese (他/她 are both "tā", so Chinese learners mix he/she); the offline-dictionary lookups
were replaced by rule-based inflection plus a small irregular-form table and a
capitalisation heuristic for names. Served by POST /v1/english/check.
